OL,3,GNEWSAThe non-football fan who snapped
OL,4,Athe game beautifully
OL,5,
OL,6,FYou might think a man who captured
OL,7,Fimages at 13 World Cups and worked as
OL,8,FFIFA's official photographer for two
OL,9,Fdecades must be passionate about
OL,10,Ffootball.
OL,12,FBut Peter Robinson, who has
OL,13,Fphotographed icons such as Diego
OL,14,FMaradona, Lionel Messi, Pele and Franz
OL,15,FBeckenbauer, admits he has never been a
OL,16,Fhuge fan of the sport itself.
OL,18,FRobinson, 82, has travelled to
OL,19,Fcompetitions in close to 100 countries
OL,20,Fin a career he describes as "bonkers".
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
