OL,3,GNEWSAThe non-football fan who snapped
OL,4,Athe game beautifully
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis work is now being celebrated in an
OL,7,Fexhibition that highlights its focus on
OL,8,Fthe stories of football off the field,
OL,9,Fphotos which curator Hugo Worthy said
OL,10,F"tell you a huge amount about football
OL,11,Fbut about life more broadly".
